# GitHub's Linguist does not know Firn. Without this file it labels this
# repository "Rust", because the bootstrap compiler is the only thing it
# recognises -- while over 300000 lines of the actual language are invisible
# to it. Better no language bar than a wrong one.
# Checked 2026-10-13: linguist-language only takes names Linguist already
# knows; "Firn" is unknown, so that line is ignored (kept for the day Firn is
# added, see docs/LINGUIST-PR/). No transitional switch makes .fi count as
# Firn; mapping it to another language would mislabel the repo.
*.fi linguist-language=Firn
*.fi -linguist-detectable
compiler/**/*.rs linguist-vendored
docs/** linguist-documentation
tests/** linguist-documentation
tools/** linguist-vendored
*.py linguist-vendored
*.sh linguist-vendored
*.rs linguist-vendored
*.s linguist-vendored
*.S linguist-vendored
*.ld linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-documentation
vorlage/** linguist-vendored
generated linguist-generated
a.out binary linguist-generated
node_modules/** linguist-vendored
editors/** linguist-vendored
